WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.674
Storm clouds filled the sky.

2
00:00:03.675 --> 00:00:06.677
Rain fell hard.

3
00:00:06.678 --> 00:00:09.880
Wind blew fast.

4
00:00:09.881 --> 00:00:13.332
The barn shook.

5
00:00:13.333 --> 00:00:22.439
"This is some storm," said Cow.

6
00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:25.947
The door banged open.

7
00:00:25.948 --> 00:00:32.011
"This storm is scary!" said Cat.

8
00:00:32.012 --> 00:00:37.028
Cat hid behind the hay.

9
00:00:37.029 --> 00:00:55.148
"Tell me when it's over!" said Cat.

10
00:00:55.149 --> 00:01:02.025
Pig put on his mask and cape.

11
00:01:02.026 --> 00:01:07.632
"Don't worry, Cat," said Pig.

12
00:01:07.633 --> 00:01:11.552
"Super Pig will save you!"

13
00:01:11.553 --> 00:01:16.805
Bat flew down.

14
00:01:16.806 --> 00:01:21.174
He was soaked.

15
00:01:21.175 --> 00:01:25.521
"Rain is coming into the barn!" he said.

16
00:01:25.522 --> 00:01:28.770
Everyone looked up.

17
00:01:28.771 --> 00:01:31.942
The roof had a big hole.

18
00:01:31.943 --> 00:01:35.718
Rain was pouring through it.

19
00:01:35.719 --> 00:01:41.364
"Super Pig will fix the roof!" said Pig.

20
00:01:41.365 --> 00:01:49.563
Pig went up to the hole.

21
00:01:49.564 --> 00:02:02.094
Rain splashed on his face.

22
00:02:02.095 --> 00:02:05.775
"Ugh!" said Pig.

23
00:02:05.776 --> 00:02:10.176
"I will wait for the rain to stop."

